# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FlameSense ignore rules
#
# This project is a dependency-free static site, so there is very little to
# ignore beyond machine- and editor-specific noise. The repository previously
# carried macOS Finder metadata into version control, which is what most of
# the OS section below exists to prevent from happening again.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Operating system metadata ---------------------------------------------
# .DS_Store is per-user Finder state (icon positions, view settings). It has no
# business in a shared repo and produces conflicts on every macOS checkout.
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editor / IDE state -----------------------------------------------------
# Per-developer workspace state: window layout, local run configs, caches.
# Shared, checked-in project settings do not belong here either, because this
# project deliberately has no editor-specific configuration.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.\#*
\#*\#

# --- Node tooling -----------------------------------------------------------
# The site itself ships no dependencies, but the test suite and the data
# tooling run under Node. Nothing generated by them should be committed.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/
.node_repl_history
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Build / deploy output --------------------------------------------------
# Vercel serves public/ directly; anything below is generated locally.
.vercel/
dist/
build/
.cache/

# --- Local environment ------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets must never be committed. No key is required to run the site today
# (every upstream API it calls is keyless), but this guards future additions.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Stray backup files -----------------------------------------------------
# Hand-made "just in case" copies that tend to accumulate next to the original.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.tmp
*.old
*.copy
